        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>第十一章 三角形</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #333;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 30px 40px;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  p {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    margin: 0.5em 0;\n  }\n  .figure-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    margin: 20px 0 5px 0;\n  }\n  .figure-item {\n    text-align: center;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .figure-item .placeholder {\n    width: 220px;\n    height: 130px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f0f0f0;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .figure-item .caption {\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n  .figure-label {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin: 5px 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .exercise-box {\n    border: 2px dashed #c8a96e;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 20px 25px;\n    margin: 25px 0;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .exercise-title {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #d4a843;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 3px 18px;\n    border-radius: 15px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    position: relative;\n    top: -30px;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .exercise-question {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .shapes-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 20px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .shape-item {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .shape-item .shape-placeholder {\n    width: 120px;\n    height: 90px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .shape-item .shape-label {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n  svg {\n    max-width: 100%;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<p>还可以发现，斜钉一根木条的四边形木架的形状不会改变，这是因为斜钉一根木条后，四边形变成两个三角形，由于三角形有稳定性，斜钉一根木条的窗框在未安装好之前也不会变形。</p>\n\n<p>三角形的稳定性有广泛的应用，图 11.1-8 表示其中一些例子，你能再举一些例子吗？</p>\n\n<div class=\"figure-row\">\n  <div class=\"figure-item\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">\n      <svg width=\"200\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\">\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#e8e4d8\"/>\n        <polygon points=\"10,100 30,60 60,40 90,30 120,35 150,50 180,70 190,100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"35\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"100\" width=\"200\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#c8c0a0\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caption\">钢架桥</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"figure-item\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">\n      <svg width=\"200\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\">\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#f5f0e8\"/>\n        <!-- crane body -->\n        <rect x=\"20\" y=\"85\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e8a020\"/>\n        <rect x=\"30\" y=\"75\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#d09018\"/>\n        <!-- wheels -->\n        <circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"108\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#555\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"55\" cy=\"108\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#555\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"108\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#555\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"108\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#555\"/>\n        <!-- crane arm -->\n        <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#e8a020\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n        <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#d09018\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n        <!-- cable -->\n        <line x1=\"165\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"165\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <!-- hook -->\n        <rect x=\"160\" y=\"55\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#888\"/>\n        <!-- support -->\n        <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#e8a020\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caption\">起重机</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"figure-label\">图 11.1-8</div>\n\n<p>四边形的不稳定性也有广泛的应用，图 11.1-9 表示其中一些例子。</p>\n\n<div class=\"figure-row\">\n  <div class=\"figure-item\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">\n      <svg width=\"200\" height=\"130\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 130\">\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" fill=\"#f5f0e8\"/>\n        <!-- expandable hanger - diamond pattern -->\n        <g stroke=\"#c89030\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\">\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"25\"/>\n          <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"25\"/>\n          <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"105\"/>\n          <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"105\"/>\n          <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"65\"/>\n        </g>\n        <g fill=\"#a07020\">\n          <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"65\" r=\"5\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"25\" r=\"5\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"65\" r=\"5\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"25\" r=\"5\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"65\" r=\"5\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\"/>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caption\">活动挂架</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"figure-item\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">\n      <svg width=\"220\" height=\"130\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 130\">\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"220\" height=\"130\" fill=\"#d8e8f0\"/>\n        <!-- retractable gate -->\n        <g stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\">\n          <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"20\"/>\n          <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <!-- X patterns -->\n          <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"110\"/>\n          <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"110\"/>\n        </g>\n        <!-- gate post -->\n        <rect x=\"175\" y=\"10\" width=\"30\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#ddd\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <rect x=\"180\" y=\"15\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#333\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caption\">伸缩门</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"figure-label\">图 11.1-9</div>\n\n<div class=\"exercise-box\">\n  <div class=\"exercise-title\">练习</div>\n  <p class=\"exercise-question\">下列图形中哪些具有稳定性？</p>\n  <div class=\"shapes-grid\">\n    <div class=\"shape-item\">\n      <div class=\"shape-placeholder\">\n        <svg width=\"110\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 110 80\">\n          <polygon points=\"10,60 40,15 90,15 60,60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-label\">(1)</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"shape-item\">\n      <div class=\"shape-placeholder\">\n        <svg width=\"110\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 110 80\">\n          <rect x=\"10\" y=\"15\" width=\"90\" height=\"50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-label\">(2)</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"shape-item\">\n      <div class=\"shape-placeholder\">\n        <svg width=\"110\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 110 80\">\n          <polygon points=\"20,40 20,65 90,65 90,40 55,15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-label\">(3)</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"shape-item\">\n      <div class=\"shape-placeholder\">\n        <svg width=\"110\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 110 80\">\n          <polygon points=\"15,20 55,10 95,20 80,65 30,65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"15\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"15\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"15\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-label\">(4)</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"shape-item\">\n     